The decentralized environmental notiﬁcation (DEN) basic service and its messages are used to notify the receivers about events and changes in the trafﬁc environment. Although the most crucial goal of C-ITS systems is to make the roads safer, trafﬁc accidents must always be expected; the DENM message protocol [45] also characterizes such events. An

